  "prompt": "The query in the editor has one mistake. Fix it so that it answers this question: for each Voltmarkt store, how many orders were placed in April 2025 (the UTC days of order_ts), and how many units did they hold? Return exactly three columns, in this order: store_code, orders and units. Return one row for each store with orders. Any row order is fine.",
